  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cool Schools in Dimbokro, C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of latrines and hand-washing stations, (menstrual) health promotion in schools, training of local sewers and distributing reusable pads to girls.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dimbokro, C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Water, Sanitation and Hygi&#xeb;ne (WASH) in schools</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving hygiene in schools to prevent children from water-borne diseases, ensuring good WASH facilities that school children can use, and preventing girl drop-out once they start menstruating.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School going children</narrative>
  </description>
